# Anchored patterns missed packages/*/ (the extracted ZOE package has its own
# _build/deps/node_modules); match at any depth.
**/_build/
**/deps/
**/node_modules/
.DS_Store
tmp/
# Dialyzer/Erlang crash dumps are local diagnostics, never repo artifacts
# (gapfix-dialyzer-010: the committed 65MB erl_crash.dump was a crashed
# dialyzer attempt; untracked here so a failed analysis cannot bloat the repo).
erl_crash.dump
*.dump
# mix test --cover HTML output
**/cover/
_build-pub/
# Root-manifest ggen sync outputs (ggen.toml: ontology.ttl + ash-extension
# pack @baa5f117). These are downstream-consumer installer/extension products,
# never ash_surface repo content: (1) zero commit history at every path;
# (2) CI (manufacture.yml -> ggen-sync-run.yml) treats them as ephemeral
# receipt evidence, never commits them; (3) generated lib/ash_r2rml/*.ex
# would collide with the real ash_r2rml dependency's modules (e.g.
# AshR2RML.Resource also in deps/ash_r2rml/lib/ash_r2rml/resource.ex).
# Fix drift in the pack/ontology, not here.
.ggen/
.ggen-v2/
.clap-noun-verb/
ggen.lock
lib/ash_r2rml/
lib/audit_trail/
lib/notification_extension/
lib/ash_surface/info.ex
lib/ash_surface/persist.ex
lib/ash_surface/resource.ex
lib/ash_surface/verify.ex
lib/mix/tasks/ash_r2rml.install.ex
lib/mix/tasks/ash_surface.install.ex
lib/mix/tasks/audit_trail.install.ex
lib/mix/tasks/notification_extension.install.ex
test/ash_r2rml_composition_test.exs
test/ash_surface_composition_test.exs
test/audit_trail_composition_test.exs
test/notification_extension_composition_test.exs

# lane-lease build roots (fan-out campaign)
target/
_build-lane*/
target-lane*/
